#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:1
#: d990724df51146d4a61ab63b6cf0018b
msgid "Release Notes v0.9.0"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:3
#: e253d4dc87174ac0a286c8ca9694447a
msgid "New Features"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:4
#: f2b421849d6943fa94abf2e9b57a4f96
msgid "1. License Management Mechanism"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:5
#: 8c7ec12204ca4e7c8c2a12a52070380a
msgid ""
"Introduced a License management feature to protect DingoDB's intellectual"
" property. With the License activation and management tools, users can "
"easily manage and monitor software usage, ensuring legal and compliant "
"use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:6
#: 6db4d66b182046cf97413a182f8b4d5d
msgid "2. Single Machine Lite Version of DingoDB"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:7
#: 35b666e708fd456da747091c6cecb9e3
msgid ""
"Implemented a Single Machine Lite version of DingoDB, lowering the usage "
"threshold for users. This version can run on a single machine without "
"complex distributed deployment, making it ideal for development, testing,"
" and small-scale application scenarios, helping users quickly get started"
" and validate DingoDB's capabilities."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:8
#: 7e6e0a4d8f78479cbdffb5d5e1fe66b4
msgid "3. New C++ SDK"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:9
#: 38d2d49b1daf4d01b627b22dc9aa7b22
msgid ""
"Provided a new C++ SDK to facilitate secondary development and "
"integration for developers. The SDK offers a rich set of APIs that "
"support efficient data operations and management, enhancing development "
"efficiency."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:11
#: e97f27bc0e2d48d990b67535153ab7ba
msgid "Feature Optimizations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:12
#: a6f82c2b4ab446b5b4fcedcd1c6e1273
msgid "Storage Layer Optimization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:13
#: 7577ad5d11304b8a9ba2f3d7da622ec1
msgid "1. Braft Modification"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:14
#: b020174782cb442db5e85989c9745150
msgid ""
"Added support for controlling election priority among peers, addressing "
"the vector index Leader balancing issue. This helps improve cluster "
"stability and performance, avoiding single-point overloads."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:15
#: 64ea9112428e4a0a8dddc92a03ea06dd
msgid "2. Prefilter Performance Enhancement"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:16
#: 0401d51bbf0546f0961727c5d40a0ad5
msgid ""
"Adjusted the data structure of ScalarData to improve pre-filtering rates."
" Through data structure optimization, DingoDB can process data filtering "
"faster, reducing query latency."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:17
#: 3a9be88078254733b8228c1955b0dc7b
msgid "3. Instruction Set Expansion"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:18
#: 08ede07723dc4c9fba95aa0bf2d6e5bf
msgid ""
"In addition to the default SSE instructions for vector distance "
"calculation functions FAISS and HNSWLIB, added support for AVX2/AVX512 "
"instruction sets. By expanding the instruction set, vector computation "
"efficiency is improved, particularly in high-performance computing "
"environments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:19
#: 12f9f2257e214848b640d7e0ba1ba1b6
msgid "4. Vector Distance Calculation Performance Improvement"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:20
#: d6e616f77ddf4838ac1596b091727997
msgid ""
"Implemented runtime CPU instruction set acceleration switching, "
"significantly enhancing vector distance calculation performance. The "
"system automatically switches instruction sets (e.g., SSE, AVX2, AVX512) "
"as needed, especially effective in handling large-scale datasets."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:21
#: b97bbed9ae9a45a18ef2574eae31c2d2
msgid "5. Leader Balance Rate Improvement"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:22
#: 89c6552d69d44fe68a52d4a2f11f5161
msgid ""
"Optimized algorithms to improve the balance rate of Leaders in the "
"cluster. The improved election algorithm ensures a more balanced "
"distribution of Leaders, enhancing the overall system performance."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:23
#: 16519c90d4e54540ace3f77f5cf70817
msgid "6. Vector Index Data Insertion Performance Improvement"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:24
#: 52332a80d6c545d8aaf3c5cb345884de
msgid ""
"Optimized the insertion performance of IVF_FLAT and IVF_PQ vector "
"indexes. The improved insertion algorithm increases data insertion "
"efficiency, reducing index build time."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:25
#: 07cf0e3944fc4b29b495a0e8d6b9c1ac
msgid "7. Synchronization Operation Performance Optimization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:26
#: ac59247166944ba5ab42c3ffc381ddfa
msgid ""
"Optimized the synchronization performance of BThread and PThread. By "
"reducing the overhead of thread synchronization, the performance in "
"multi-threaded environments is enhanced."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:27
#: 17a02f60b28f4461bf5c7ce5a19bb86d
msgid "8. Vector Search Performance Improvement"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:28
#: 18e35ea9e5154be99f3ad31f66089b54
msgid ""
"Adjusted parameters such as Region size, Region count, and number of "
"threads to effectively improve vector search performance. Optimized "
"resource allocation significantly boosts search response speed and "
"efficiency."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:30
#: 2ed97e0f6c8d44868977622a9b96f2a5
msgid "Computation Layer Optimization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:31
#: e34f6706751e488fbbf879fc4c66c749
msgid "1. Log System Optimization"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:32
#: 7bc8bafae9194c54b86494d53cd9df68
msgid ""
"Revamped the Executor layer log system to provide full-link log "
"information, enhancing log traceability. The improved log system records "
"more detailed information, helping users comprehensively monitor and "
"analyze various events during task execution."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:33
#: 0b3a67b999de40918682038cdb41afb9
msgid "2. Observable Metrics"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/release_notes/dingodb_0_9_0_rn.md:34
#: 5a44baeeb468467a893cf944870b5312
msgid ""
"Introduced a new Metric information statistics feature to monitor job "
"metrics at various stages, enhancing task observability. By monitoring "
"performance metrics in real time, users can better understand task "
"execution and performance bottlenecks, improving system operation and "
"maintenance efficiency."
msgstr ""

